REST API Endpoints
-------------------
Method	URL	                                    Description
POST	http://localhost:8080/student/save	    Save Student
GET	http://localhost:8080/student/all	    Get All Students
GET	http://localhost:8080/student/{id}	    Get Student By ID
PUT	http://localhost:8080/student/update/{id}   Update Student
DELETE	http://localhost:8080/student/delete/{id}   Delete Student

1. Save Student (POST)
-----------------------
URL
POST http://localhost:8080/student/save

Valid JSON
{
    "name": "Subham Behera",
    "email": "subham@gmail.com",
    "mobile": "9876543210"
}

Invalid Data If we input its Showing That.

{
    "name":"A",
    "email":"abc",
    "mobile":"12345"
}
That The Message.

{
    "name": "Name should contain 3 to 20 characters",
    "mobile": "Enter Valid Mobile Number",
    "email": "Invalid Email"
}

2. Get All Students (GET)
-------------------------
URL
GET http://localhost:8080/student/all

No JSON Body Required

3. Get Student By Id (GET)
---------------------------
URL
GET http://localhost:8080/student/1

No JSON Body Required

4. Update Student (PUT)
-----------------------
URL
PUT http://localhost:8080/student/update/1

Valid JSON
{
    "name": "Rahul Kumar",
    "email": "rahul@gmail.com",
    "mobile": "9876543210"
}

5. Delete Student (DELETE)
---------------------------
URL

DELETE http://localhost:8080/student/delete/1



